INSERT INTO inform.politician_context (politician_id, topic_id, reasoning, sources) SELECT '18b11787-c861-4996-aba5-3b863ea33b1d', ct.id, $ctx$As a member of a state trade-policy commission, was quoted in December 2025 saying tariff policy was "hurting Maine people and businesses" and that "some of the tariffs make no sense" -- criticizing broad, unpredictable tariffs as economically harmful while not calling for total tariff elimination, matching the scale's reduce-most-tariffs chair.$ctx$, ARRAY['https://www.maine.gov/housedems/news/state-commission-hears-about-impacts-tariffs-maine']::text[] FROM inform.compass_topics ct WHERE ct.topic_key='tariffs' ON CONFLICT (politician_id, topic_id) DO UPDATE SET reasoning=EXCLUDED.reasoning, sources=EXCLUDED.sources;
