INSERT INTO inform.politician_context (politician_id, topic_id, reasoning, sources) SELECT '2e737f21-8570-4ad2-8d68-9b0678ac2c3f', ct.id, $ctx$In the 131st Legislature (per the 1/31/2024 Maine House Democrats press release; that LD number has since been reused for an unrelated 132nd bill so is not re-cited here) she introduced legislation to establish a state Office of New Americans providing English-language, workforce, and integration support for immigrants and refugees. She also co-authored a December 2025 open letter with two Somali American House colleagues defending Somali immigrants and TPS holders against President Trump's rhetoric.$ctx$, ARRAY['https://www.maine.gov/housedems/news/dhalac-proposal-would-create-office-new-americans-maine-state-government','https://www.maine.gov/housedems/news/reps-abdi-dhalac-and-yusuf-respond-president-trumps-attacks-somali-americans']::text[] FROM inform.compass_topics ct WHERE ct.topic_key='immigration' ON CONFLICT (politician_id, topic_id) DO UPDATE SET reasoning=EXCLUDED.reasoning, sources=EXCLUDED.sources;
