INSERT INTO inform.politician_context (politician_id, topic_id, reasoning, sources) SELECT '6c9d5b66-c843-4170-ae7b-f516832b2312', ct.id, $ctx$As a Judiciary Committee member, Babin personally led the committee minority 'Ought To Pass As Amended' report on LD 1656, An Act to Facilitate Compliance with Federal Immigration Law by State and Local Government Entities (June 2025), pushing for passage after the majority recommended killing it; the majority Ought-Not-To-Pass report ultimately prevailed and the bill died. His committee leadership on this specific state/local-cooperation-with-federal-immigration-enforcement bill is a direct, individual, on-the-record position, matching 'honor ICE detainers and share information proactively when federal agencies request it.'$ctx$, ARRAY['https://legislature.maine.gov/bills/display_ps.asp?snum=132&paper=HP1097&PID=1456']::text[] FROM inform.compass_topics ct WHERE ct.topic_key='local-immigration' ON CONFLICT (politician_id, topic_id) DO UPDATE SET reasoning=EXCLUDED.reasoning, sources=EXCLUDED.sources;
