INSERT INTO inform.politician_context (politician_id, topic_id, reasoning, sources) SELECT 'a37ec3f9-faa6-4c06-8856-92fa618a28ad', ct.id, $ctx$In a March 1, 2024 Weekly Republican Radio Address on Maine's Emergency Housing Relief Fund spending roughly $34 million (63% of the fund) to temporarily house asylum seekers, Henderson argued generous public assistance draws more migration and opposed Gov. Mills' goal of welcoming 75,000 new Mainers this decade -- favoring restricted public services for people without legal status.$ctx$, ARRAY['https://mainehousegop.org/newsroom/maine-is-making-international-news/']::text[] FROM inform.compass_topics ct WHERE ct.topic_key='immigration' ON CONFLICT (politician_id, topic_id) DO UPDATE SET reasoning=EXCLUDED.reasoning, sources=EXCLUDED.sources;
