INSERT INTO inform.politician_context (politician_id, topic_id, reasoning, sources) SELECT 'b08821e4-7a92-498c-97f2-13138777e8ae', ct.id, $ctx$In a Feb. 16, 2024 House GOP caucus statement on Maine's Emergency Housing Relief Fund spending roughly $34.28 million to temporarily house about 2,200 asylum seekers, Schmersal-Burgess called the spending 'horrible mismanagement of taxpayer dollars' while stating support for legal immigration tied to employment -- favoring legal pathways while opposing public benefits/services for asylum seekers awaiting status.$ctx$, ARRAY['https://mainehousegop.org/member_news_item/republicans-uncover-shocking-cost-of-our-open-border-policy/']::text[] FROM inform.compass_topics ct WHERE ct.topic_key='immigration' ON CONFLICT (politician_id, topic_id) DO UPDATE SET reasoning=EXCLUDED.reasoning, sources=EXCLUDED.sources;
